  "body": "\"Let (_variableOne_, _variableTwo_) be the result of _functionReturningTuple_\" is a valid statement, but is not documented in [Tuples](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#tuples).\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @domenic in https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1134#issuecomment-1347741093_\r\n> We've been doing it as \"Let (_prefix_, _localName_) be the result of...\" but only for tuples, not lists. (And it's not documented anywhere.)\r\n      ",
